B.a1Z=s(["Start the rewarded ad from the Council menu.","Watch the top bar 10x countdown.","Tap any building to inspect the unified green Total Synergy & Burst stat."],t.s)
B.Zz=s(["Sinerji Patlamas\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131\u015f ay\u0131 \xf6ncesinde veya ambarlar\u0131 doldurmak istedi\u011finizde stratejik olarak kullan\u0131n.","Birbirine biti\u015fik \xfcretim zincirleri (Tarla -> De\u011firmen -> F\u0131r\u0131n) patlama s\u0131ras\u0131nda 20x-40x verime ula\u015f\u0131r."],t.s)
